{"author":{"id":"2462ded6f56967dde059994c39a506c79e39e5dfd10c5a07f07a23a5652a8353"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1776276150,"nonce":"UrgiQkrM+AP+M/muerI+MJqTmW8=","title":"Make test_timeout_s configurable in workspace config","message":"## Problem\n\nThe test command timeout during pre-review rebase is hardcoded to 120 seconds in `core/rebase.py`. For repos with large test suites, this may not be enough time.\n\nUsers should be able to configure this in WORKFLOW.md and REVIEW.md:\n\n```yaml\nworkspace:\n  kind: worktree\n  base_branch: master\n  test_command: \".venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/ -v\"\n  test_timeout_s: 300  # new field, default 120\n```\n\n## Tests (write first, must fail before implementation)\n- tests/test_config_factories.py::test_workspace_config_parses_test_timeout\n  Assert: `WorkspaceConfig` with `test_timeout_s: 300` parses correctly\n- tests/test_rebase.py::test_uses_configured_timeout\n  Assert: `_run_test_command` uses timeout from config, not hardcoded 120\n\n## Files\n- core/config/models.py (add test_timeout_s field to WorkspaceConfig)\n- core/config/loader.py (parse test_timeout_s from YAML)\n- core/rebase.py (use config timeout instead of hardcoded constant)\n- tests/test_config_factories.py (add test)\n- tests/test_rebase.py (add test)\n\n## Implementation\n1. Add `test_timeout_s: int = 120` to `WorkspaceConfig` in `core/config/models.py`\n2. Parse `test_timeout_s` in `_parse_workspace()` in `core/config/loader.py`\n3. Pass `test_timeout_s` to `_run_test_command()` in `core/rebase.py` instead of using `TEST_COMMAND_TIMEOUT_S`\n4. Keep `TEST_COMMAND_TIMEOUT_S = 120` as the default value\n\n## Patterns to follow\nSee existing `test_command` field in WorkspaceConfig for the pattern.\n\nREQ: REQ-031","files":null}]}